WHAT IS COVERED

  · the dimensional data and its provenance: src/config/*, src/data/*, and the
    reasoning written beside every number in those files;
  · the documentation in docs/ and README.md;
  · the survey schedule, the conflict records, and the notes on what the model
    cannot vouch for.

This is the part of the project that took the work: not that the tower is 16.5 m
across, which is published, but the record of which figures are measured, which
are estimated, which are placeholders, and what would settle each one.

